    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d148">

                <pb facs="0267" n="1021" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp02v02/pg1021"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 600.119/205</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Swedish Commercial Delegate</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Nordvall</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum</hi>
                </p>
                <p>List of Swedish steamers now lying in different ports in U. S. with cargo
                    consigned to Sweden which steamers cannot proceed until permission of visitation
                    at port outside England has been granted.</p>
                <p>The following list does not include steamers with grain consigned to the Swedish
                    Government which are still lying in different ports in U. S. A. and which
                    according to agreement made with England are to be allowed to proceed.</p>
                <table cols="6" rows="15">
                    <row role="label">
                        <cell>5.</cell>
                        <cell>S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Oscar Fredrik</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell>From</cell>
                        <cell>Newport News</cell>
                        <cell>Cargo</cell>
                        <cell>pie iron</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>3.</cell>
                        <cell>S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Sir Ernest Cassel</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>Philadelphia</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>coal and lubricants</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>2.</cell>
                        <cell>S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Bia</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>Halifax</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>maize</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>2.</cell>
                        <cell>S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Boren</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>Halifax</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>pig iron and cotton</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>5.</cell>
                        <cell>S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Ocean</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>Halifax</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>general</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>4.</cell>
                        <cell>S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Regina</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>Savannah</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>cottonseed cakes</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>4.</cell>
                        <cell>S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Olivia</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>Savannah</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>4.</cell>
                        <cell>S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Irene</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>Savannah</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>2.</cell>
                        <cell>S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Emanuel</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>Norfolk</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>maize</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>1.</cell>
                        <cell>S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Torbjörn</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>Newport News</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>phosphate</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>4.</cell>
                        <cell>S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Elisabeth</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>Savannah</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>Cottonseed cakes</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>4.</cell>
                        <cell>S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Aila</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>Savannah</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>1</cell>
                        <cell>S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Sigrid</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>Norfolk</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>phosphate</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>2.</cell>
                        <cell>M.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Pacific</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>Colon</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>nitrate</cell>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <cell>2.</cell>
                        <cell>S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Alida</hi>
                        </cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>Buenos Aires</cell>
                        <cell>“</cell>
                        <cell>maize</cell>
                    </row>
                </table>
                <p>The figures indicate in which order vessels should proceed.</p>
                <p>I understand S.S. <hi rendition="#italic">Sir Ernest Cassel</hi> has already been
                    afforded facilities to proceed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. R. Nordvall</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                    <lb/><dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1917-06-15"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">June 15, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
